<%= @resource_type %> Has Expired
===============================================

Hello <%= @user.name || @user.email %>,

Your <%= @resource_type %> "<%= @resource_name %>" has EXPIRED as of <%= @resource.expires_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>.

This resource is no longer valid and may cause build failures or service interruptions. Please renew or replace it as soon as possible.

Review Now: <%= case @resource
                when AppleCertificate
                  organization_apple_certificates_url(@resource.organization)
                when AppleProvisioningProfile
                  organization_apple_provisioning_profiles_url(@resource.organization)
                else
                  polymorphic_url([@resource.organization, @resource])
                end %>

Thanks,
My Signer Team
